      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1217 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene bw_snarling_hedges has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 45 coins / 180 stars."
